  "detail": "RF-95 mechanism executed and passed all five conditions, but this bundle cannot be independently reconstructed and is therefore undeterminable under ADR-0101, not passed. Two defects: (1) the run did not bind its preregistration -- TaskContext.preregistration was not threaded, so trajectory preregistration_digest is empty and the candidate is tied to its frozen document by commit ordering rather than an in-run digest; (2) the ledger artifact was written to a volatile temporary directory and its bytes no longer match the digest recorded here, so the material is unresolvable. The runner now threads preregistration and can export portable artifacts (tools/runners/run_rf95_product_proof.py --preregistration --evidence-dir). Closing M-4 requires re-executing one newly authorized candidate under the fixed runner. No reviewer signature is present and none is claimed.",
